---
const SUBSTACK_URL = "https://substack.com/@leadfromthehip";
---
<div>
	<h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-ink mb-2">One pattern, one rep, most weeks.</h2>
	<p class="text-muted measure mb-4">
		A short piece on a recurring leadership pattern, the belief underneath it, and one
		specific thing to do about it. No course launches, no funnel. Unsubscribe whenever.
	</p>
	<a
		href={SUBSTACK_URL}
		class="inline-block bg-petrol text-paper px-4 py-2 rounded-[3px] font-medium hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-petrol"
	>
		Subscribe on Substack →
	</a>
</div>
